  GIBBS: <p>Plant Control. Every ledger in the plant closes on this desk, every load on the plain comes off this board, and nothing is sealed or shed until somebody senior has said the sentence out loud.</p>
  EQUIL: <p>The Reactor Hall. Carbon dioxide and hydrogen go in and methane and water come out, along with a great deal of heat that has to be somewhere by the end of the interval.</p>
