  SOIL: <p>The Water Plant. Ice from the cut becomes water the stacks can split, and the ions that came up with it become somebody else's problem downstream if they are not taken out here.</p>
  ELEC: <p>The Electrolysis Hall. Water in, hydrogen and oxygen out, and a number of kilowatt-hours that the array decides and the habitat has first claim on.</p>


